WEBVTT

00:25.520 --> 00:29.250
That day, humanity remembered...

00:35.110 --> 00:38.180
the terror of being ruled by them.

00:40.590 --> 00:45.240
The humiliation of being kept in a cage.

01:03.850 --> 01:05.410
Prepare for combat!

01:06.230 --> 01:07.460
We have one target...

01:07.930 --> 01:11.890
Defeat it, and make this humanity's 
first base outside the walls.

01:13.010 --> 01:14.300
Target approaching!

01:19.650 --> 01:21.580
Split into five groups, just as we practiced!

01:22.700 --> 01:24.560
We'll be the decoys!

01:24.980 --> 01:27.350
Attack teams, switch to 
Three-Dimensional Maneuver Gear!

01:49.470 --> 01:51.590
We'll strike from all directions at once!

01:57.160 --> 01:59.640
We'll show you the power

01:59.640 --> 02:00.930
of humanity!

03:34.980 --> 03:39.990
To You, 2,000 Years in the Future 
The Fall of Zhiganshina (1)

04:06.860 --> 04:09.150
Huh? Mikasa...

04:09.940 --> 04:11.430
Let's head back.

04:12.730 --> 04:14.850
What am I doing here?

04:16.200 --> 04:18.800
You're so out of it. 
Were you sound asleep?

04:19.150 --> 04:20.000
No...

04:20.550 --> 04:24.700
It's just, I feel like I had a really long dream.

04:26.780 --> 04:28.390
What was it about?

04:28.810 --> 04:30.380
I can't remember...

04:34.420 --> 04:36.670
Eren, why are you crying?

04:42.050 --> 04:44.590
The Year: 845 — Zhiganshina District

04:48.050 --> 04:49.000
Listen!

04:49.560 --> 04:52.350
These walls were constructed with God's wisdom!

04:52.760 --> 04:55.560
They were given to us by God himself!

04:56.310 --> 05:00.090
None may defile them!

05:02.920 --> 05:07.320
Don't tell anyone that I was crying.

05:07.320 --> 05:08.570
I won't...

05:09.360 --> 05:12.580
But if you're crying for no reason,

05:12.900 --> 05:15.080
why not have your dad check you over?

05:15.080 --> 05:16.540
No way!

05:16.890 --> 05:18.830
I can't tell my dad about it.

05:18.830 --> 05:20.960
What are you crying over, Eren?

05:22.880 --> 05:24.150
Hannes!

05:24.700 --> 05:26.720
Did Mikasa get mad at you for something?

05:27.960 --> 05:30.170
Why would that make me cry?

05:30.170 --> 05:31.580
And you stink of alcohol!

05:32.640 --> 05:34.280
Oh, come on...

05:35.720 --> 05:37.240
You're all drinking again?

05:37.240 --> 05:39.230
Why don't you join us?

05:39.230 --> 05:41.920
Um, but don't you have work?

05:41.920 --> 05:43.980
Yeah! We're guarding the gate today.

05:44.620 --> 05:49.580
We spend all day here, so eventually, 
we get hungry and thirsty.

05:49.910 --> 05:53.340
And the fact that some of what 
we drink may be alcohol...

05:53.340 --> 05:55.370
Well, that isn't too big a problem.

05:56.830 --> 05:59.210
Can you fight like that if you have to?

06:00.830 --> 06:02.350
If we have to? When would we...

06:02.350 --> 06:03.300
When else?!

06:03.820 --> 06:06.760
If they breached the walls 
and entered the city!

06:10.830 --> 06:12.030
Ow...

06:12.030 --> 06:15.420
Hey, Eren, don't yell like that...

06:16.600 --> 06:19.020
The doctor's son is pretty lively today.

06:19.650 --> 06:23.630
If they ever do breach 
the walls, we'll do our jobs.

06:23.930 --> 06:28.080
But that hasn't happened 
for a hundred years.

06:28.080 --> 06:32.050
But my dad says that you're in the most danger

06:32.050 --> 06:33.390
when you lower your guard!

06:33.850 --> 06:35.930
Doctor Jaeger, huh?

06:35.930 --> 06:37.040
Well, he's right...

06:37.620 --> 06:41.730
He once saved the whole city from an epidemic.

06:42.430 --> 06:44.650
We owe him more than we could ever repay.

06:44.940 --> 06:47.920
But that has nothing to do with them.

06:49.300 --> 06:52.080
As a soldier, when you go up to repair the walls,

06:52.080 --> 06:55.350
you can sometimes see them, 
wandering around outside.

06:55.900 --> 07:00.640
But this wall is fifty meters high. 
They can't do anything about it.

07:01.040 --> 07:02.270
Th-Then,

07:02.600 --> 07:05.900
you're actually not prepared to fight them?

07:05.900 --> 07:07.180
Nope.

07:08.170 --> 07:09.540
What?!

07:09.540 --> 07:13.880
Then stop calling yourselves the Garrison, 
and become the Wall Repair Corps!

07:13.880 --> 07:15.700
I wouldn't mind that...

07:17.270 --> 07:18.870
But listen, Eren...

07:18.870 --> 07:22.710
If we're fighting, 
it means things are bad.

07:23.240 --> 07:27.800
As long as everyone's laughing at us 
and calling us useless freeloaders,

07:27.800 --> 07:29.880
that means we're all safe.

07:32.830 --> 07:36.400
Even if we can never leave 
these walls for our entire lives,

07:37.020 --> 07:39.640
as long as we eat and sleep, we'll survive...

07:40.050 --> 07:42.570
But that makes us just like...

07:44.150 --> 07:46.190
Just like cattle!

07:49.430 --> 07:51.750
That's a brave kid you have there.

07:51.750 --> 07:54.920
Not like he could do anything 
about it, huh, Hannes?

07:55.420 --> 07:56.850
Y-Yeah.

07:58.710 --> 08:00.470
Hey, Eren!

08:01.820 --> 08:03.540
Strange kid.

08:04.470 --> 08:08.590
Does he want to join the Survey Corps?

08:17.810 --> 08:20.870
Eren, you should stop considering the Survey Corps.

08:22.060 --> 08:25.250
What? You're going to tell 
me they're stupid, too?

08:25.550 --> 08:28.160
That isn't it...

08:35.010 --> 08:37.240
The Survey Corps is back!

08:37.540 --> 08:39.200
The front gate's opening!

08:39.200 --> 08:40.250
Let's go, Mikasa!

08:40.250 --> 08:41.630
The heroes are back!

08:54.610 --> 08:56.640
Damn it, I can't see!

09:25.460 --> 09:27.690
These are all that made it back?

09:28.250 --> 09:30.090
Everyone else must've been eaten.

09:31.090 --> 09:34.200
That's what happens when 
you go outside the walls.

09:34.520 --> 09:37.090
Moses! Moses!

09:37.650 --> 09:41.440
Um, my son, Moses... I don't see him.

09:41.440 --> 09:43.470
Where is he?

09:44.810 --> 09:46.710
This is Moses's mother.

09:47.280 --> 09:48.290
Bring it.

10:14.290 --> 10:17.180
That is all we managed to retrieve.

10:33.980 --> 10:36.020
But my son...

10:36.020 --> 10:37.900
He helped, right?

10:39.910 --> 10:43.250
Even if he didn't do anything directly...

10:43.250 --> 10:45.040
My son's death helped humanity

10:45.380 --> 10:48.540
fight back, didn't it?!

10:55.130 --> 10:56.160
Of course!

11:00.120 --> 11:01.120
No.

11:02.370 --> 11:05.520
Our recon this time didn't...

11:05.870 --> 11:06.680
No,

11:07.100 --> 11:08.330
we never...

11:10.980 --> 11:14.670
Never learn a thing!

11:15.680 --> 11:17.690
It's my fault...

11:18.150 --> 11:20.370
My own incompetence killed our men!

11:21.080 --> 11:27.640
And we still don't even know what they are!

11:33.600 --> 11:35.230
What a mess...

11:35.230 --> 11:36.550
You've got that right.

11:37.120 --> 11:41.350
It's like our taxes all go to fatten them up.

11:44.740 --> 11:46.540
What are you doing, stupid brat?

11:49.000 --> 11:49.850
Hey!

11:49.850 --> 11:51.440
What are you doing, Mikasa?!

11:52.560 --> 11:53.980
Get back here!

11:55.880 --> 11:58.360
Mikasa, you can let go now!

12:03.860 --> 12:05.230
What was that for?

12:05.230 --> 12:07.100
The firewood spilled everywhere!

12:08.330 --> 12:09.370
Eren,

12:10.000 --> 12:13.210
do you still want to join the Survey Corps?

12:21.600 --> 12:23.780
Help me pick these up...

12:25.180 --> 12:26.870
There isn't enough to bother.

12:28.970 --> 12:32.980
Information We Can Share So Far: 

About the Walls (1) 
Humanity lives within three walls. 
The outermost is Wall Maria. 
The second, Wall Rose. 
The innermost is Wall Sina.

12:32.980 --> 12:36.980
Information We Can Share So Far: 

About the Walls (2) 
Distance between each is roughly the same. 
100km separate Maria and Rose. 
130km separate Rose and Sina. 
From Sina to the center is about 250km.

12:42.320 --> 12:43.450
Back.

12:45.240 --> 12:46.600
Welcome home.

12:49.950 --> 12:51.160
Oh, Eren!

12:51.160 --> 12:53.500
You actually worked hard for a change.

12:53.950 --> 12:55.210
Yeah...

12:58.570 --> 12:59.870
What?

12:59.870 --> 13:01.530
Your ears turned red.

13:01.530 --> 13:03.340
That means you're lying.

13:03.340 --> 13:05.590
Mikasa helped you, didn't she?

13:06.850 --> 13:09.320
Huh? Are you going somewhere, Dad?

13:09.960 --> 13:10.960
Work?

13:10.960 --> 13:13.580
Yes, I'm going inland to see patients.

13:13.580 --> 13:15.290
Probably for two or three days.

13:18.630 --> 13:21.610
Eren said he wants to join the Survey Corps.

13:26.240 --> 13:28.320
M-Mikasa, I told you not to tell them!

13:28.320 --> 13:28.990
Eren!

13:29.740 --> 13:31.370
What are you thinking?

13:31.670 --> 13:35.310
Do you know how many people 
have died outside the walls?

13:35.740 --> 13:36.960
I do!

13:36.960 --> 13:38.000
In that case...

13:38.000 --> 13:38.900
Eren...

13:40.720 --> 13:43.380
Why do you want to go outside?

13:44.920 --> 13:48.760
I want to know what it's like out there.

13:49.310 --> 13:53.130
I don't want to spend my life inside 
the walls, not knowing anything!

13:53.680 --> 13:54.770
Also...

13:55.570 --> 13:57.900
If no one carries on their work,

13:58.670 --> 14:01.400
all the casualties till now will have been in vain!

14:05.660 --> 14:06.860
I see.

14:08.660 --> 14:10.140
The ship is waiting.

14:10.140 --> 14:11.580
I'll be going now.

14:11.580 --> 14:13.050
Wait...

14:13.050 --> 14:14.450
You need to talk to Eren!

14:14.790 --> 14:18.020
Karla, human curiosity is not something

14:18.020 --> 14:20.890
you can restrain with a lecture.

14:21.540 --> 14:22.340
Eren...

14:23.900 --> 14:25.170
When I get back,

14:25.170 --> 14:28.840
I'll show you what I've kept secret 
in the basement all this time.

14:29.290 --> 14:31.260
R-Really?

14:35.050 --> 14:36.810
Bye!

14:39.010 --> 14:40.290
I won't let you.

14:41.620 --> 14:43.600
Joining the Survey Corps? 
Don't be stupid.

14:43.600 --> 14:45.650
Huh? Stupid?!

14:45.650 --> 14:48.760
I think people who're fine being cattle

14:48.760 --> 14:50.360
are way more stupid!

14:50.990 --> 14:51.850
Eren!

14:55.030 --> 14:56.120
Mikasa,

14:56.500 --> 14:58.820
sometimes he doesn't think things through.

14:59.270 --> 15:01.710
When you're in trouble, 
you must help one another.

15:02.340 --> 15:03.190
Okay.

15:06.330 --> 15:07.880
What's wrong, heretic?

15:09.250 --> 15:11.850
If you don't like it, hit back!

15:12.910 --> 15:14.810
No way.

15:14.810 --> 15:17.110
That would put me on your level!

15:17.110 --> 15:18.100
What?!

15:18.410 --> 15:21.390
You know what I said is true.

15:21.800 --> 15:24.270
That's why you're hitting me instead of arguing.

15:25.260 --> 15:28.420
Doesn't that mean you admit I win?

15:29.890 --> 15:32.080
Shut your damned mouth!

15:32.080 --> 15:33.560
Stop it!

15:35.280 --> 15:36.240
That's Eren!

15:36.940 --> 15:38.760
The fool's back.

15:38.760 --> 15:40.090
He wants to get his ass kicked?

15:40.090 --> 15:41.430
Let's give him what he wants!

15:42.910 --> 15:44.590
M-Mikasa's here, too!

15:45.410 --> 15:48.010
N-No... Let's get out of here!

15:53.480 --> 15:56.240
They ran away when they saw me!

15:56.240 --> 15:58.950
No, they ran when they saw Mikasa.

15:58.950 --> 15:59.860
Ouch...

16:00.470 --> 16:02.440
Hey, are you okay, Armin?

16:06.660 --> 16:08.360
I can stand on my own.

16:09.140 --> 16:10.320
All right.

16:13.360 --> 16:18.360
So I said that humanity should 
go out into the world someday.

16:18.360 --> 16:20.650
And they hit me and called me a heretic.

16:20.650 --> 16:21.710
Damn it.

16:23.800 --> 16:27.640
Why does everyone act like you're 
crazy if you want to go outside?

16:27.640 --> 16:32.790
Because staying within the walls has 
brought peace for a hundred years.

16:33.260 --> 16:38.100
They're afraid that if many of us 
venture out, we'll risk letting them in.

16:38.370 --> 16:43.980
So the royal government declared 
any interest in the outside world taboo.

16:44.590 --> 16:47.730
That's our lives we're risking, 
so it's our business!

16:48.050 --> 16:49.190
You can't.

16:51.420 --> 16:52.430
No.

16:52.780 --> 16:55.920
Come to think of it, why did you tell my parents?

16:56.850 --> 16:58.580
I don't remember ever saying I'd help.

16:58.580 --> 16:59.910
H-How did it go?

17:00.570 --> 17:03.580
Well... They weren't happy.

17:05.190 --> 17:06.420
I bet.

17:10.800 --> 17:11.670
But you're right.

17:12.390 --> 17:17.470
I wonder about those who think staying 
inside the walls will protect us forever.

17:17.470 --> 17:18.980
Mom!

17:21.330 --> 17:24.520
Just because the walls haven't 
been breached in a hundred years

17:25.080 --> 17:27.450
doesn't mean they won't be

17:29.280 --> 17:30.750
breached today...

17:50.510 --> 17:51.590
What?

17:51.590 --> 17:52.640
An explosion?

17:53.880 --> 17:54.670
Over there!

17:54.670 --> 17:56.130
I think something fell from the sky!

17:58.820 --> 18:00.070
Hey, Armin!

18:04.000 --> 18:05.180
What's wrong?

18:05.650 --> 18:07.520
What can you see?

18:17.600 --> 18:19.110
No way...

18:19.110 --> 18:20.620
That wall

18:21.280 --> 18:23.450
is fifty meters tall!

18:24.630 --> 18:25.950
It's one of them...

18:31.940 --> 18:33.250
A Titan!

19:19.790 --> 19:20.890
It broke...

19:21.830 --> 19:23.890
a hole in the wall...

19:28.840 --> 19:29.890
They're coming inside!

19:30.370 --> 19:32.650
The Titans are getting inside!

19:36.230 --> 19:37.420
We have to get out of here!

19:38.270 --> 19:38.900
Eren!

19:39.270 --> 19:40.650
My house is over there...

19:41.350 --> 19:42.410
My mom!

19:43.700 --> 19:44.660
Mikasa!

19:50.930 --> 19:52.540
It's all over...

19:53.300 --> 19:55.750
The Titans are going

19:56.940 --> 19:59.510
to take the city!

20:05.400 --> 20:07.000
Nothing hit my house!

20:07.470 --> 20:08.810
Once I turn that corner,

20:08.810 --> 20:10.730
my house will still be there!

20:15.340 --> 20:16.450
Mom!

20:19.040 --> 20:20.070
Mom!

20:22.190 --> 20:22.840
Eren...

20:22.840 --> 20:24.740
Mikasa, grab that side!

20:24.740 --> 20:26.090
We have to get this off her!

20:45.160 --> 20:46.430
Hurry, Mikasa!

20:46.430 --> 20:47.350
I know.

20:48.270 --> 20:50.790
The Titans are inside, aren't they?

20:51.650 --> 20:53.850
Eren, take Mikasa and run!

20:53.850 --> 20:55.070
Now!

20:55.520 --> 20:56.860
I want to run!

20:56.860 --> 20:58.970
So hurry and get out of there!

20:59.870 --> 21:02.820
My legs were crushed by the rubble.

21:03.710 --> 21:05.980
Even if I get out, I can't run.

21:07.260 --> 21:08.340
You understand, don't you?

21:08.340 --> 21:10.320
Then I'll carry you!

21:10.320 --> 21:12.660
Why do you never listen to me?!

21:13.600 --> 21:15.820
At least listen this one last time!

21:16.320 --> 21:17.500
Mikasa!

21:18.620 --> 21:19.810
No...

21:20.230 --> 21:21.120
No!

21:22.090 --> 21:24.050
If you don't go, all three of us will...

21:26.060 --> 21:26.900
Hannes!

21:29.360 --> 21:31.520
Take the children and run!

21:32.740 --> 21:35.080
Don't underestimate me, Karla.

21:35.570 --> 21:39.370
I'll defeat the Titan, and save you all!

21:40.120 --> 21:41.010
Wait!

21:41.010 --> 21:42.440
Don't try to fight it!

21:43.450 --> 21:44.290
She's right.

21:44.290 --> 21:46.110
If it were just the kids, I could save them.

21:46.110 --> 21:50.070
But I'm going to repay that family 
for what they've done for me!

22:06.580 --> 22:08.410
Wait, Hannes!

22:08.410 --> 22:10.260
What are you doing?!

22:11.420 --> 22:12.770
Thank you.

22:13.430 --> 22:15.520
My mom is still back there!

22:16.390 --> 22:18.440
Eren! Mikasa!

22:19.270 --> 22:21.390
You must survive!

22:34.170 --> 22:35.790
Don't go...

22:46.430 --> 22:49.930
Stop!

23:23.600 --> 23:27.000
That day, humanity remembered...

23:31.960 --> 23:34.760
<i>the terror of being ruled by them.</i>

23:37.100 --> 23:41.800
<i>The humiliation of being kept in a cage.</i>

23:53.950 --> 23:55.670
The Fall of Zhiganshina.

23:56.330 --> 24:00.830
All humanity could do 
was pray, scream, and die...

24:01.710 --> 24:03.330
Among them, Eren was

24:03.330 --> 24:06.550
the only one to swear revenge.

24:04.500 --> 24:06.960
That Day 
The Fall of Zhiganshina (2)

24:06.960 --> 24:09.950
Illustration: Shuuzou Oshimi (<i>The Flowers of Evil</i>)
